   "id": "no_confidentiality_clause",
   "severity": "high",
   "message": "The agreement has no confidentiality obligations, so the contractor is not bound to protect Northwind's confidential information about its ML infrastructure.",
   "quote": "You assign to us all intellectual property in the work product you create under this Agreement."
  },
  {
   "id": "no_termination_for_convenience",
   "severity": "medium",
   "message": "Northwind cannot end the engagement without cause; it can only terminate for a material breach left uncured for 30 days, which limits flexibility if the work is no longer needed.",
